Description:It is your first main phase. You have drawn no cards this turn. You have Opt (scry 1, then draw a card) in hand with {U}{R} floating, and the only card in your library is Thunderous Wrath (5 damage to any target; miracle {R}). The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
